OL,3,GNEWSA'I knew something was wrong when
OL,4,Amy baby's head was too big'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNot long after Bethany Hardy's daughter
OL,7,Fwas born, she felt something was wrong
OL,8,Fwith her new baby.
OL,10,FNancy's head was a strange shape and
OL,11,Fmuch larger than her body, and she
OL,12,Fstruggled to lift it.
OL,14,FBy the time she was nine months, her
OL,15,Fparents, from Leeds, were seriously
OL,16,Fworried about their child.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
