OL,3,GNEWSA'I knew something was wrong when
OL,4,Amy baby's head was too big'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNancy was a year old when she was
OL,7,Feventually diagnosed with sagittal
OL,8,Fcraniosynostosis, a rare condition
OL,9,Fwhere the skull does not grow properly
OL,10,F- but the delay meant she had to
OL,11,Fundergo more invasive surgery.
